summary.label:
Featured features
WIFI sharing, devices under the same WIFI can use the WIFI sharing function to scan and play, without the need to transmit or copy videos.

Supported video formats:
Mp4, mkv, avi, flv, f4v, mov, m4v, mod, mpg, rmvb, rm, ra, ram, mpeg, mpe, swf, wav, wmv, asf, asx, 3gp, vob, webm, ts, dat, div, dv, divx, xvid, lavf, cpk, dirac, qt, fli, flc, etc.

Supported image formats:
Png, jpg, jpeg, gif, bmp, svg, tiff, etc.

Main functions:
1. Import videos and photos from a computer or album, and manage the classification of videos and photos;
2. Support operations such as search, move, copy, rename, etc;
3. Support video and photo encryption to protect privacy;
4. Online video playback;
5. Image viewing;
6. Supports dark mode;
7. Support for multiple languages;

Player function:
1. Lock the playback interface to prevent misoperation;
2. Play at multiple speeds, up to 4 times faster, and support saving playback speeds;
3. Swipe the screen horizontally to adjust the progress, slide left to rewind and right to fast forward;
4. Vertical sliding to adjust screen brightness or volume, left sliding to adjust screen brightness, right sliding to adjust volume;
5. Long press and hold the screen to play at multiple speeds, with customizable long press and hold speeds, supporting speeds of 0.3 to 4;
6. Fixed duration fast forward and rewind, customizable fast forward and rewind duration;
7. Screen capture, supporting saving to the folder where the album or video is located;
8. Double click on the screen to play or pause;
9. Support skipping the beginning and end of the film;
10. Support seamless playback;
11. Support background playback;
12. Support switching playback order;
